  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5502.01 Registration.\n\n(a) Every sexual offender, irrespective of the date of the conviction of the sexual offense(s) listed in RSA 651-B:1, V, shall register when he or she is released into the community as provided in RSA 651-B:3.\n\n(b) Every offender against children, irrespective of the date of the conviction of the offense(s) listed in RSA 651-B: 1, VII, shall register when released into the community as provided in RSA 651-B:3.\n\nSource. #5537, eff 1-1-93; ss by #5689, INTERIM eff 8-20-93, EXPIRES: 12-18-93; ss by #5727, eff 10-22-93; amd by #5776, eff 1-25-94; ss by #6314, EMERGENCY eff 8-9-96, EXPIRES: 12-7-96; ss by #6324, INTERIM eff 8-22-96, EXPIRES: 12-20-96; ss by #6358, eff 10-22-96; ss by #6919, INTERIM, eff 1-1-99, EXPIRES: 5-1-99; ss by #6990, EMERGENCY, eff 4-30-99, EXPIRES: 8-28-99; ss by #7066, eff 7-28-99, EXPIRED: 7-28-07\n\nNew. #10121, eff 4-25-12; ss by #13504, eff 12-9-22",
